  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.103 Volunteer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.103 “Volunteer” means a person or member of a nonprofit fire department or nonprofit emergency medical service unit who provides services on an as needed basis and who does not receive compensation, other than reimbursement for expenses actually incurred.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
